    {
      "_id": "6af2a5d9df21e14167ed2350",
      "title": "인공지능이 정말 난방비를 절약해 줄 수 있을까요?",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IMsbmrxj5oc/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"인공지능이 정말 난방비를 절약해 줄 수 있을까요?\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">인공지능이 정말 난방비를 절약해 줄 수 있을까요? 주제를 다룬 The Guardian 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Can smart <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">thermostats</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Can smart thermostats and AI reduce your heating bills?\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> and AI reduce your heating bills?</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">스마트 온도조절기와 AI가 난방비를 줄일 수 있을까?</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. thermostat: 온도조절기 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">It also performs automatic <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">hydronic</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"It also performs automatic hydronic balancing to increase efficiency...\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> balancing to increase efficiency...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">또한 효율을 높이기 위해 온수 난방의 유량 균형을 자동으로 조절한다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. hydronic: 냉난방 순환수식의 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">...insulated <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">loft</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"...insulated loft conversion as the test bed.\" aria-label=\"...insulated loft conversion as the test bed. 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> conversion as the test bed.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">단열 처리된 다락 개조 공간을 시험 장소로 사용했다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. loft: 다락, 고미다락 (명)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">I concluded that AI can save you money on your <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">heating bill</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"I concluded that AI can save you money on your heating bill.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">나는 AI가 난방비를 절약해 줄 수 있다는 결론을 내렸다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. heating bill: 난방비 (명사구)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The AI is built by Tado using <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">anonymised</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"The AI is built by Tado using anonymised data collected from more than 1m homes.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> data collected from more than 1m homes.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">Tado의 AI는 100만 가구 이상에서 수집한 익명화된 데이터를 활용해 개발됐다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. anonymised: 익명화된 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">rooms needed to be <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">ventilated</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"rooms needed to be ventilated\" aria-label=\"rooms needed to be ventilated 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">방들을 환기할 필요가 있었다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. ventilate: 환기하다 (동)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">my <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">miserly</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"my miserly manual control\" aria-label=\"my miserly manual control 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> manual control</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">내가 지나치게 아끼며 하던 수동 조절</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. miserly: 구두쇠 같은, 지나치게 인색한 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">less <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">frugal</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"less frugal in the first place\" aria-label=\"less frugal in the first place 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> in the first place</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">애초에 덜 절약하는</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. frugal: 검소한, 절약하는 (형)</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IMsbmrxj5oc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Guardian | Can AI really save you money on your heating bill? I spent two years testing to find out | By Samuel Gibbs Consumer technology editor</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/money/2026/nov/07/can-ai-save-you-money-heating-bill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
