    {
      "_id": "6af2a5dddf21e14167ed2365",
      "title": "데이터센터 반발이 빅테크 기업에 유리하게 작용할 수 있는 이유는 무엇일까요?",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RKYKiiolPkQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"데이터센터 반발이 빅테크 기업에 유리하게 작용할 수 있는 이유는 무엇일까요?\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">데이터센터 반발이 빅테크 기업에 유리하게 작용할 수 있는 이유는 무엇일까요? 주제를 다룬 The Wall Street Journal 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">If you’re a data center that is already running, or have power in place, there’s <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">scarcity value</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"If you’re a data center that is already running, or have power in place, there’s scarcity value.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">이미 가동 중이거나 전력이 확보된 데이터센터라면 희소 가치가 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. scarcity value: 희소 가치</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">It could actually <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">play into the hands of</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"It could actually play into the hands of many players in AI.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> many players in AI.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">오히려 AI 업계의 많은 기업에 유리하게 작용할 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. play into the hands of: ~에게 유리하게 작용하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Giants like Amazon and Microsoft stand to benefit from a <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">shakeout</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Giants like Amazon and Microsoft stand to benefit from a shakeout.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">아마존·마이크로소프트 같은 거대 기업들은 업계 재편의 수혜자가 될 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. shakeout: 업계 재편, 구조조정</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">More <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">roadblocks</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"More roadblocks emerging for the construction of data centers.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> emerging for the construction of data centers.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">데이터센터 건설에 더 많은 장애물이 생겨나고 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. roadblocks: 장애물</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Can <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">ratchet down</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Can ratchet down cost pressures on supplies, labor and credit.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> cost pressures on supplies, labor and credit.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">자재·인건비·자금 조달 비용에 대한 압박을 단계적으로 낮출 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. ratchet down: 단계적으로 낮추다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RKYKiiolPkQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Wall Street Journal | How the Data Center Backlash Could Play Into the Hands of Big Tech | By Telis Demos</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/tech/ai/how-the-data-center-backlash-could-play-into-the-hands-of-big-tech-a37dfb29\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
