      "_id": "6af3dce112fd78f09cb503b7",
      "title": "젠슨 황의 스캔들이 어떻게 국가 안보 악몽으로 번졌는가",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/J_AZkuMvBKg/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"젠슨 황의 스캔들이 어떻게 국가 안보 악몽으로 번졌는가\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">젠슨 황의 스캔들이 어떻게 국가 안보 악몽으로 번졌는가 주제를 다룬 The Wall Street Journal 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">...has <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">lobbied</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"...has lobbied President Trump on loosening export controls.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> President Trump on loosening export controls.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">수출 통제 완화를 위해 트럼프 대통령에게 로비해 왔다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. lobby: 로비하다, 설득하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">...whether Alice Huang’s company, Megaspeed, was illegally <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">diverting</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"...whether Alice Huang’s company, Megaspeed, was illegally diverting AI chips made by Nvidia for use in China...\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> AI chips made by Nvidia for use in China...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">메가스피드가 엔비디아 AI 칩을 중국에서 사용하도록 불법 우회 공급했는지 여부.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. divert: 우회시키다, 전용하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">...no reason to believe that either national security or Nvidia secrets were <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">compromised</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"...no reason to believe that either national security or Nvidia secrets were compromised.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">국가안보나 엔비디아의 기밀이 위태롭게/유출/침해됐다고 볼 이유는 없다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. compromise: 위태롭게 하다, (보안·기밀을) 침해하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Huang apologized for <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">infidelity</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Huang apologized for infidelity to his family and Nvidia colleagues in a staff memo.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> to his family and Nvidia colleagues in a staff memo.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">황은 직원들에게 보낸 메모에서 가족과 엔비디아 동료들에게 자신의 불륜에 대해 사과했다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. infidelity: 불륜, 부정행위</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">They have raised sharp new questions about how Nvidia <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">wielded</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"They have raised sharp new questions about how Nvidia wielded its influence...\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> its influence...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">엔비디아가 어떻게 영향력을 행사했는지에 대한 날카로운 의문이 새롭게 제기됐다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. wield: (권력·영향력을) 행사하다, 휘두르다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">The Nvidia <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">contingent</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"The Nvidia contingent argued that the government should approve export licenses for the H20...\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> argued that the government should approve export licenses for the H20...</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">엔비디아 대표단은 정부가 H20 칩의 수출 허가를 승인해야 한다고 주장했다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. contingent: 대표단, 일행</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J_AZkuMvBKg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Wall Street Journal | How Jensen Huang’s Affair Spiraled Into a National Security Nightmare | By Robbie Whelan and Amrith Ramkumar</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/tech/ai/how-jensen-huangs-affair-spiraled-into-a-national-security-nightmare-d9b43304\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
